        <activityName xml:lang="en">Fluorspar, 97%, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Fluorspar, 97%, at plant
Basic inventory based on old literature information.;
CAS number: 14542-23-5; 
Formula: CaF2; 
Synonyms: calcium fluoride; 
UUID: cda2f091-4583-3bac-bfeb-fdbddeb5142c
Mineral extraction of calcium fluoride (fluorspar).
Location: Main producers are China, South Africa and Mexico. Some data of calcium fluoride produced in Germany.
Technology: Open cast mining of resource. Separation by crushing, grinding and flotation.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: A few million tonnes per year.
Sampling: Literature and own estimations. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_cda2f091-4583-3bac-bfeb-fdbddeb5142c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
